title: "Coral Reef Survey Photos labeling round-trip built with Pixeltable"
abstract: "Segment coral-reef survey photos, send the model's boxes to Label Studio as pre-annotations, re-import the reviewed labels and diff them against the model, with COCO and LanceDB exports, all as Pixeltable tables and computed columns."
